  "releaseNotes": "## 12.4.0\n\n### Features\n- In-document links work in the exported PDF. A `#name` link becomes a GoTo action to the page its bookmark lands on, every bookmark becomes a named destination in the catalog's `/Dests`, and a markdown heading that a link targets by its slug gets one too. A link to a name nothing carries writes no annotation; it used to write a `/URI` action that opened nothing. Bookmarks inside footnotes are not destinations.",
